{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Reject invalid primitive and numeric shapes.** Wrong primitive types fall through to `return []`, while fractional values and `NaN` also pass the numeric bounds checks. Because the local runner bypasses Lambda's wire serializer, unsupported inputs such as `context.wait({ seconds: 1.5 })` can work locally but fail in production. Validate primitive types and require finite integers for numeric members, with regression tests for fractional, non-finite, and wrong-type values.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs7-R7v0","finding_digest":"87e5adc12b99591932af5c5848772083640fb1948b8a1dc12ff0f72811b7fc17","finding_id":"arf_v1_q7s23qjltfmrsmvplrmeq5zaqn","finding_key":"checkpoint-server/validate-update-model::member-errors::primitive-and-integer-shape-validation","identity_key":"checkpoint-server/validate-update-model::member-errors::primitive-and-integer-shape-validation","line":240,"observation_digest":"46a5f8c646d203b8580a2d9cf89352980cb37f44d54321f5d83bddad3beab070","observation_id":"aro_v1_i2s7rrsg2ib3qwakfwopre2sta","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-testing/src/checkpoint-server/validators/validate-update-model.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-14T02:22:18Z","review_id":"arr_v1_m3mktvndpmuss7d7pzweztcjg4","reviewed_base_sha":"08ba0f6e29d7faaaaa99a6acde407db9c9854e2f","reviewed_head_sha":"60885082bdb12f8f194b8f39ffce214ffc7d8a9b","reviewer":"codex","start_line":234,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":996},"record_id":"art_v1_lxydtpfo5knk62rc4nf4xeojax","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-14T02:22:18Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
